config SOC_STM32H747_M7
    bool "ST STM32H747, Cortex-M7"
    select SOC_STM32H7
    select CPU_CORTEX_M7
    help
      The Cortex-M7 of the STM32H747, CPU1, which sets up the supply and
      the clocks and starts the Cortex-M4.

config SOC_STM32H747_M4
    bool "ST STM32H747, Cortex-M4"
    select SOC_STM32H7
    select CPU_CORTEX_M4
    help
      The Cortex-M4 of the STM32H747, CPU2, which runs once the Cortex-M7
      starts it, and leaves the supply and the clock tree to it.
